to receive a {{amount}} reward if (i) you join the Affiliate Program for the first time; and (ii) your Facebook group is reviewed and approved by Temu. The reward will be issued to your available balance and cannot be withdrawn unless your total earnings in the available balance exceed {{withdrawCash}}. You may withdraw the reward as cash via PayPal or other available methods displayed on the Affiliate Program page, or redeem it as Temu Credits. Temu Credits cannot be redeemed for cash. Check the details on the program page and Temu Affiliate Policy.","code_rule_desc_text_v3":"New App users only. Download Temu app and claim the coupon with the coupon code. The coupon applies to a single order only within the applicable product scope (if any) and cannot be combined with other offers. Order value over {{orderMinAmount}} is required. The discount is capped at {{amount}}. The coupon will expire at {{expireTime}} (local time) on the day after activating the code. <span>T&Cs apply.</span>","affiliate":{"left":"<Prefix>left</Prefix><TimePicker />","off":"OFF","auto_jump_app_timer":"({{time}}s)","sign_in_to_claim_countdown":"Sign in to Claim<time>({{sec}}s)</time>","get_and_use_now_countdown":"Get & use now <time>({{sec}}s)</time>"},"cps-retain-popup":{"dont-miss-best-prize":"Don’t let the benefit get away!","dont-miss-coupon":"Don’t let the coupon bundle get away!","give-up":"Give Up","shop-now":"Shop Now","save-now":"Save Now","sign-in-to-claim":"Sign in to Claim","expire-in":"<Prefix>Expire in</Prefix><TimePicker />","cart-can-save":"Your cart is eligible to <span> Save {{money}}</span>","pick-more-to-save":"Pick {{amount}} more to <span> Save {{money}}</span>"},"noChannelGoodsQAReasn":{"CART_EXIST_GOODS":"One Shopping cart can only add one item with the 'Exclusive Deal' price. You can still add it at a discounted price.","NO_CHANNEL_PRICE":"Sorry, Items at Exclusive Deal prices are sold out. You can still buy it at a discounted price.","USER_NO_QA":"Only new App users c