t.","coupon_item_v1":"This is a {{amount}} off coupon, applicable to an order over {{minAmount}}.","coupon_item_v3":"{{couponCount}} * {{amount}} off on orders over {{minAmount}}","coupon_off_rules_common":"The {{amount}} coupon bundle includes: <Coupons />. Each coupon can be used once and expires {{days}} day(s) from receipt.","coupon_cannot_be_combined":"Coupons from the {{amount}} coupon bundle cannot be combined with other coupons in the coupon bundle.","search_code_in_temu_app":"You need to search {{code}} in the Temu app at Coupons&offer or Checkout page to get the {{discount}} off coupon on an order.","only_claim_once":"New app users only. Each participant may only claim once.","coupon_item_valid_hours":"The coupon is valid for {{hours}} hours after receipt.","discount_coupon_item":"The {{discount}} off coupon is applicable to an order over {{minAmount}}, and capped at {{maxAmount}}.","coupons_applied_conditions":"Coupons can be applied to your future orders that meet the terms and conditions (e.g., threshold) shown on the coupons to reduce the payment amount.","download_app_claim_coupon":"Download Temu app via this ad and claim a {{amount}} coupon bundle in the app within {{hours}} hours of downloading the Temu app for the first time.","coupon_rules_popup_part_pc":"*For illustrative purpose only. Obtain {{amount}} coupon bundle by (1) scanning the QR code or accessing this page via your mobile browser. (2) downloading the Temu application through the provided affiliate link or QR code. This offer is for new app users only.","download_app_claim_coupon_off_ko":"New App users only. Download and register for the Temu app via this ad and claim a {{amount}} coupon bundle and a {{discount}} off coupon in the app within {{hours}} hours of downloading the Temu app for the first time.","download_app_claim_coupon_ko":"New App users only. Download and register for the Temu app via this ad and claim a {{amount}} coupon bundle in the app within {{hours}} hours of downloa